    <p>We provide the site "as is" without warranties of any kind. While we strive for accuracy, we do not guarantee that every result is free of error. You use the tools at your own risk.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Try Online Calculator is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, this site.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to misuse the site, attempt to disrupt it, or scrape it in a way that degrades service for others.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site means you accept the current terms.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
